## 11. Out of Scope (explicitly)

- Implementation language, framework, or process model for the Gateway.
- Storage engine selection beyond "V2-prefixed, WAL-backed".
- Concrete numeric values for caps, freshness windows, cooldown durations — these belong in the policy instance and Config Admin GUI, not the contract.
- Live-trading promotion workflow — separate document and separate human approval gate.

